% Chapter 2: our first rules, built on the pond's facts.
accumulate pond.

% ANCHOR: grazer
pred grazer o:critter.
grazer X :- eats X algae.
% ANCHOR_END: grazer

% ANCHOR: wet_lunch
pred wet_lunch o:critter, o:critter.
wet_lunch X Y :- eats X Y, swims Y.
% ANCHOR_END: wet_lunch

% ANCHOR: hunter
pred hunter o:critter.
hunter X :- eats X frog.
hunter X :- eats X fish.
% ANCHOR_END: hunter
